    "summary": "Spend 1 CP as your Movement phase starts. Pick 1 **TITANIC CHAOS KNIGHTS** unit of yours and up to 3 friendly **WAR DOG** units 6\" or less from it.\n\nFor the rest of the phase, whenever a chosen **WAR DOG** unit makes a Normal, Fall Back or **Advance move**, its models:\n\n- May pass through other models and **terrain features**.\n- May enter **Engagement Range** of models they pass, but cannot finish the move there.\n- Automatically pass any **Desperate Escape** test.",
